msgid "Look again"
msgstr "Torna a mirar"

#: zypp_desk/pages/updates.py:248
msgid "Since the last refresh of the repositories. On Tumbleweed your routine (zypper dup) updates everything at once; here you can pick only some."
msgstr "Segons l'última consulta als repositoris. A Tumbleweed la teva rutina (zypper dup) ho actualitza tot alhora; aquí en pots triar només alguns."

#: zypp_desk/pages/updates.py:252 zypp_desk/pages/updates.py:393
#: zypp_desk/pages/updates.py:511 zypp_desk/tray.py:715
